WEBVTT

00:03.600 --> 00:09.360
Uncle Qiu wrote saying he took a ninth concubine I sent someone with a pair of gold bracelets.

00:09.480 --> 00:13.480
To tell him that's enough an eighteen-year-old bride, an eighty-year-old groom.

00:13.800 --> 00:15.800
He lives more freely than I.

00:16.920 --> 00:21.493
I just come here to escape the noise don't have to listen to their nagging.

00:23.040 --> 00:27.813
Fortunately, I gave birth to a daughter can peacefully accompany Your Majesty and Yu'er.

00:28.160 --> 00:33.920
Don't need to worry about other matters but Your Majesty you always bring official documents here.

00:34.800 --> 00:37.827
My place here isn't the Imperial Administration Palace.

